      "rationale": "Longer and shorter are both asked, and the competency's two objects - lengths measured in paperclips and distances measured in blocks or hands - each get their own items."
    },
    "cognitive_capacity": {
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "rationale": "Choosing between two stated quantities is a single-step judgment, and the vocabulary stays at longer, shorter and the unit names with no measurement language from a later grade."
    },
